{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921160/extras/77c819b00728ffc22d3bfab91d52bc8e.poster.avif?t=1758010004\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921160/extras/77c819b00728ffc22d3bfab91d52bc8e.webm?t=1758010004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bend the Rules of Gravity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Using your rotation abilities, navigate through rooms filled with countless creative puzzles by walking along walls, ceilings, and from unusual angles.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921160/extras/66aa50a0e55d8a3b86c2862b3503b933.poster.avif?t=1758010004\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921160/extras/66aa50a0e55d8a3b86c2862b3503b933.webm?t=1758010004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921160/extras/66aa50a0e55d8a3b86c2862b3503b933.mp4?t=1758010004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Room is a New Perspective</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This journey will take you to unique rooms. Here, not only your intelligence but also your sense of direction will be tested. Each section will offer a new mechanic, each corner a new perspective. Nothing is as it seems in Flipside.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921160/extras/22380a3527880f5d3552523b511636a8.poster.avif?t=1758010004\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921160/extras/22380a3527880f5d3552523b511636a8.webm?t=1758010004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921160/extras/22380a3527880f5d3552523b511636a8.mp4?t=1758010004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Retro Meets Modern in a Pixel World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flipside features a vibrant pixel-art atmosphere enhanced by smooth animations and subtle lighting effects. Retro visuals meet modern design in a world that feels both nostalgic and fresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921160/extras/03fd1214d31bd2f37e5546339ca4151e.poster.avif?t=1758010004\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921160/extras/03fd1214d31bd2f37e5546339ca4151e.webm?t=1758010004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921160/extras/03fd1214d31bd2f37e5546339ca4151e.mp4?t=1758010004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT\u2019S INSIDE? PROBABLY TOO MUCH \u2013 BUT LET\u2019S LIST IT ANYWAY:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Nearly 100 lovingly hand-crafted levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Over 100+ actual colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotating levels that twist your mind. And perspective. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Secret paths, hidden levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Minimal UI, maximal emotions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bug? Or feature? You decide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- And yes... a few soft, squishy endings to make you feel things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921160/extras/a6fe3c0aa57d6ae869f5a31230427561.poster.avif?t=1758010004\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921160/extras/a6fe3c0aa57d6ae869f5a31230427561.webm?t=1758010004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921160/extras/a6fe3c0aa57d6ae869f5a31230427561.mp4?t=1758010004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you're too lazy to read this far, this game is literally spinning</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready to Rotate your world. Coming soon\u2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921160?t=1758010004","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921160/bc54d9bc0524baddf7f513b1b46f49ae1368b624/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758010004","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921160/fa62d9718594b0653627e94a1ac1a05419c11626/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758010004","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921160/fa62d9718594b0653627e94a1ac1a05419c11626/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758010004","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921160/extras/77c819b00728ffc22d3bfab91d52bc8e.poster.avif?t=175801